FHWA Pavement Derived (FHWA-Pavement-Derived.ttf), version 1.000

Supplied by the StripeMaker project owner for pavement word messages. From the
font's name table: "Derived from public FDOT and FHWA pavement marking vector
diagrams. Independently assembled; not an agency-issued font."

scripts/import-markings.py converts its outlines to assets/markings/font.js,
which the app uses; the TTF is kept here as the source.
